    "description": "Ethereum Cloud Mining Application for mobile has revolutionized the way people can participate in cryptocurrency mining.\r\n\r\nOur app is remotely manage the mining of cryptocurrency. Our app never uses a device's CPU or GPU for cryptocurrency mining operations and not run unrelated background processes. Our APP will not cause potential damage to the hardware, such as battery drain and excessive heat.\r\n\r\nSimply download the app, create an account, and start mining Ethereum on the cloud miner. It provides a convenient and accessible platform for both beginners and experienced miners to earn Ethereum rewards.\r\n\r\nWe developed free and fastest cryptocurrency app to mine Ethereum with advance digital technology. There are many ways to earn money in the cryptocurrency world. Trading crypto is the one way, but another is mining the crypto coin currency with phone through blockchain technology. We are providing referral bonus and opportunity to make your eth network with our app. You can create social network with friends to increase mining rate for earning ethereum .\r\n\r\nFeatures of Ethereum Mining App:\r\n\r\n- Start free eth miner with single click.\r\n- Free to mine and easy to use.\r\n- User Ranking System\r\n- Enable wallet system.\r\n- Highest mining hash rate with our cloud rigs.\r\n- Welcome bonus for new users.\r\n- Referral bonus for each invited friends.\r\n\r\nETH is the latest and new digital cryptocurrency which has good value in the future. We are providing ETH mining to mine Ethereum in our cloud server. This app allows you to access and grow your social network by referring friends and earn Ethereum free.\r\n\r\nThe application requires an internet connection to log in and establish a connection with our cloud server. You have to press on the Start Button to start cloud mining and you will be connected with our crypto cloud rigs. The server handles everything on the cloud. Therefore, once a connection is established and start your mining, the app doesn't require the device to keep it open or run in the background to earn coin.\r\n\r\nOur Crypto coin app provides the below services directly or indirectly:\r\n\r\n- Cloud Mining\r\n- Ethereum Mining \r\n- Crypto coin mining\r\n- ETH Cloud mining\r\n- Ethereum Cloud Mining\r\n- ETH Cloud\r\n- Ethereum Cloud Mining Master\r\n- ETHMiner Pro App\r\n- Ethminer for android\r\n- Crypto Cloud\r\n- ETH miner App\r\n- Earn Ethereum Daily\r\n- Mine and Earn ETH\r\n- Free Ethereum Earning Apps\r\n- ETH Earning Apps\r\n- Coin Mining\r\n- Ethereum Earning App\r\n- Free Mining App\r\n\r\n24/7 support:\r\nIf you have questions, problems, and suggestions for the ETH miner app, please contact our customer support team at miningcrypto199@gmail.com\r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\nThere are a few rules you need to follow in order to avoid cancellations or suspensions:\r\n\r\n- Don\u2019t try to change your device if it is not necessary.\r\n- Don\u2019t create multiple and/or fake accounts.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n\r\nOur App does not mine cryptocurrency on devices but allows users to remotely manage the cloud-based mining on our website through this APP.\r\nThis app does not utilize your device resources to mine Ethereum. You can always verify this by looking at your device resource usage while the app is running.",
